    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "サクラバクシンオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Bakushin O",
            "jpText": "これはこれはお2人とも、\r\n誕生日ありがとうございますっ！",
            "enText": "Oh, you shouldn't have. Thank you for the \nbirthday wishes!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -6408511816947922649,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "ふえぇ……！？　お、お祝いしようと\n思ったのに、先にお礼言われちゃった……！？",
            "enText": "<i>Hweh?!</i> W-We were just about to wish \nyou happy birthday, but now you've \nalready thanked us…!?",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 4410684893752916072,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラバクシンオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Bakushin O",
            "jpText": "常に1歩先を行く！\r\nこれぞバクシン的誕生日です！",
            "enText": "Always stay one step ahead! \nThat's the Bakushin birthday way!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -2975045801634242261,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ミホノブルボン",
            "enName": "Mihono Bourbon",
            "jpText": "バクシンオーさん、来年のお誕生日\nおめでとうございます。",
            "enText": "Bakushin O, happy next birthday.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -7215494436624401908,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラバクシンオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Bakushin O",
            "jpText": "なんと！？　来年のお祝いを今するとは、\r\nさすがブルボンさんの驚異的スピード！",
            "enText": "What?! Already racing into next \nyear — that's the Bourbon speed \nI know!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -1693637463012058854,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラバクシンオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Bakushin O",
            "jpText": "ですが私もスピードでは負けられません！\n再来年の誕生日、ありがとうございます！",
            "enText": "But speed happens to be my forte as well! \nThank you for next next year's birthday \nwishes!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 6444754423292579496,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ミホノブルボン",
            "enName": "Mihono Bourbon",
            "jpText": "では、3年後のお誕生日\r\nおめでとうございます。",
            "enText": "Then happy next next next birthday.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 6365141744456123548,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラバクシンオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Bakushin O",
            "jpText": "やりますね、ブルボンさん！！\nならば4年後の誕生日ありがとうございます！",
            "enText": "You've done it again, Bourbon! Well then, \nthank you for next next next next year's \nbirthday wishes!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -8159726955299566234,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "なんか競い合いみたいに\nなっちゃったけど……。",
            "enText": "How did this turn into a competition…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 2434055661009154329,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "えっと、とにかくおめでとうございますっ！",
            "enText": "Um, a-anyways, happy birthday!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 1469613972157494195,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
